1817
02:37:03,664 --> 02:37:06,300
<font color="#ffff00">Aku tahu soal kehidupanmu di Bumi.</font>

1818
02:37:07,668 --> 02:37:08,903
<font color="#ffff00">Benar.</font>

1819
02:37:09,003 --> 02:37:10,554
<font color="#ffff00">Benar.</font>

1820
02:37:12,673 --> 02:37:18,312
<font color="#ffff00">Kalau kau mengikutiku,
