1833
02:38:08,062 --> 02:38:11,966
<font color="#ffff00">Murph mengatakan kau
sangat suka bertani.</font>

1834
02:38:12,066 --> 02:38:15,411
<font color="#ffff00">Benarkah? /
Ya, kemarilah.</font>

1835
02:38:15,695 --> 02:38:20,725
<font color="#ffff00">Selamat datang di rumah.
Semuanya ditaruh dan ditata sama.</font>

1836
02:38:27,039 --> 02:38:29,150
<font color="#ffff00">Hei, bukankah ini-- /
Benar.</font>

1837
02:38:29,250 --> 02:38:32,320
<font color="#ffff00">Mesin yang kami temukan dekat planet
Saturnus, saat kami menemukanmu.</font>

1838
02:38:32,420 --> 02:38:35,156
<font color="#ffff00">Sumber tenaganya mati, tapi
kami bisa berikan yang baru.</font>

1839
02:38:35,256 --> 02:38:37,725
<font color="#ffff00">Terima kasih.</font>

1840
02:38:38,634 --> 02:38:40,269
<font color="#ffff00">Pengaturan.</font>

1841
02:38:40,428 --> 02:38:42,229
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Pengaturan umum.</i></font>

1842
02:38:42,430 --> 02:38:44,565
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Pengaturan keamanan.</i></font>

1843
02:38:46,976 --> 02:38:49,570
<font color="#ffff00">Pengaturan kejujuran yang baru...</font>

1844
