1847
02:38:58,404 --> 02:39:00,181
<font color="#ffff00">...75%</font>

1848
02:39:00,281 --> 02:39:01,915
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Diterima.</i></font>

1849
02:39:02,283 --> 02:39:05,478
<font color="#ffff00">Penghancuran diri dalam 
