1850
02:39:05,578 --> 02:39:07,796
<font color="#ffff00">Mari turunkan jadi 60%.</font>

1851
02:39:09,790 --> 02:39:12,218
<font color="#ffff00">Diterima, 60%.</font>

1852
02:39:12,543 --> 02:39:15,929
<font color="#ffff00">Tok, tok. /
Kau mau diturunkan ke 55%?</font>

1853
02:39:20,509 --> 02:39:22,936
<font color="#ffff00">Apa ini sama seperti dulu?</font>

1854
02:39:24,847 --> 02:39:27,566
<font color="#ffff00">Tak sebersih ini, kawan.</font>

1855
